#: src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:38 src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:40
#: src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:46 src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:49
#: src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:50 src/integrator/stepper-timing.adoc:51
