"'5301-5310' - Koordinatensystem 5, G58 für X, Y, Z, A, B, C, U, V, W & R. "
"Persistent."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gcode/overview.adoc:334
msgid ""
"'5321-5330' - Coordinate System 6, G59 for X, Y, Z, A, B, C, U, V, W & R.  "
