"At startup, *iocontrol.0.tool-from-pocket* = 0.  An M61Q__n__ (_n_!=0) "
"command does not change the *iocontrol.0.tool-from-pocket*.  An M61Q0 "
"(_n_==0) command sets *iocontrol.0.tool-from-pocket* to 0."
