msgstr "*Zugriff auf `INFO`-Daten*. Verwenden Sie diese allgemeine Syntax:"

#. type: Title ==
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:229
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Action`"
msgstr "`Action`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:232
msgid "*`Action`* library is used to *command LinuxCNC's motion controller*."
msgstr ""
"*`Action`* Bibliothek wird verwendet, um *die Bewegungssteuerung von "
"LinuxCNC* zu steuern."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:234
msgid ""
"It tries to hide incidental details and add convenience methods for "
"developers."
