#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:765
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Keylookup`"
msgstr "`Keylookup`"

#. FIXME Shouldn't it be Keylookup ?!
#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:770
msgid ""
"*`Keylookup`* module is used to *allow keypresses to control behaviors* such "
"as jogging."
msgstr ""
"Das Modul *`Keylookup`* wird verwendet, um *Tastendrücke zur Steuerung von "
"Verhaltensweisen* zu ermöglichen wie z.B. Joggen."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:772
msgid ""
"It's used inside the handler file to facilitate creation of *key bindings* "
"such as keyboard jogging, etc."
msgstr ""
"Sie wird in der Handler-Datei verwendet, um die Erstellung von "
"*Tastenbindungen* wie z. B. Tastatur-Jogging usw. zu erleichtern."

#. type: Block title
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:775
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import `Keylookup` module"
msgstr "Modul `Keylookup` importieren"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:786
#, no-wrap
msgid "from qtvcp.lib.keybindings import Keylookup\n"
msgstr "from qtvcp.lib.keybindings import Keylookup\n"

#. type: Block title
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:788
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instantiate `Keylookup` module"
msgstr "Instanziieren des Moduls `Keylookup`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:791
msgid ""
"To instantiate `Keylookup` module* so you can use it, add this Python code "
"to your instantiate section:"
msgstr ""
"Um das `Keylookup`-Modul* zu instanziieren, damit Sie es verwenden können, "
"fügen Sie diesen Python-Code zu Ihrem Instanziierungsabschnitt hinzu:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:799
#, no-wrap
msgid "KEYBIND = Keylookup()\n"
msgstr "KEYBIND = Keylookup()\n"

#. type: Block title
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:801
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add Key Bindings"
msgstr "Hinzufügen von Tastenbelegungen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:805
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`Keylookup` requires code under the `processed_key_event` function to call `KEYBIND.call()`.\n"
"Most handler files already have this code."
msgstr ""
"'Keylookup' erfordert Code unter der Funktion 'processed_key_event', um 'KEYBIND.call()' aufzurufen.\n"
"Die meisten Handlerdateien verfügen bereits über diesen Code."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:807
msgid ""
"In the handler file, under the _initialized function_ use this general "
"syntax to *create keybindings*:"
msgstr ""
"In der Handler-Datei, unter der _initialisierten Funktion_ verwenden Sie "
"diese allgemeine Syntax, um *Tastenbindungen* zu erstellen:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:811
#, no-wrap
msgid "KEYBIND.add_call(\"DEFINED_KEY\",\"FUNCTION TO CALL\", USER DATA)\n"
msgstr "KEYBIND.add_call(\"DEFINED_KEY\",\"FUNCTION TO CALL\", USER DATA)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:814
msgid "Here we add a keybinding for `F10`, `F11` and `F12`:"
msgstr "Hier fügen wir eine Tastenbindung für `F10`, `F11` und `F12` hinzu:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:828
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# at this point:\n"
"# the widgets are instantiated.\n"
"# the HAL pins are built but HAL is not set ready\n"
"def initialized__(self):\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F10','on_keycall_F10',None)\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F11','on_keycall_override',10)\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F12','on_keycall_override',20)\n"
msgstr ""
"# zu diesem Zeitpunkt:\n"
"# sind die Widgets instanziiert.\n"
"# die HAL-Pins sind gebaut, aber HAL ist nicht bereit\n"
"def initialized__(self):\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F10','on_keycall_F10',None)\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F11','on_keycall_override',10)\n"
"    KEYBIND.add_call('Key_F12','on_keycall_override',20)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:832
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"And then we need to *add the functions that get called*.\n"
"In the handler file, under the `KEY BINDING CALLS` section, add this:"
msgstr ""
"Und dann müssen wir *die Funktionen hinzufügen, die aufgerufen werden*.\n"
"Fügen Sie in der Handler-Datei unter dem Abschnitt `KEY BINDING CALLS` Folgendes hinzu:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:838
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#####################\n"
"# KEY BINDING CALLS #\n"
"#####################\n"
msgstr ""
"#####################\n"
"# KEY BINDING CALLS #\n"
"#####################\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:842
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"def on_keycall_F12(self,event,state,shift,cntrl,value):\n"
"    if state:\n"
"        print('F12 pressed')\n"
msgstr ""
"def on_keycall_F12(self,event,state,shift,cntrl,value):\n"
"    if state:\n"
"        print('F12 pressed')\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:846
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"def on_keycall_override(self,event,state,shift,cntrl,value):\n"
"    if state:\n"
"        print('value = {}'.format(value))\n"
msgstr ""
"def on_keycall_override(self,event,state,shift,cntrl,value):\n"
"    if state:\n"
"        print('value = {}'.format(value))\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:848
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key Defines"
msgstr "Tastenbelegungen"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:853
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Here is a list of recognized key words. Use the quoted text.\n"
"Letter keys use 'Key_' with the upper or lower letter added.\n"
"e.g., 'Key_a' and 'Key_A'."
msgstr ""
"Hier finden Sie eine Liste mit anerkannten Schlüsselwörtern. Verwenden Sie den zitierten Text.\n"
"Buchstabenschlüssel verwenden 'Key_' mit dem hinzugefügten Groß- oder Kleinbuchstaben.\n"
"z. B. 'Key_a' und 'Key_A'."

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:972
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"keys = {\n"
"    Qt.Key_Escape: \"Key_Escape\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Tab: \"Key_Tab\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Backtab: \"Key_Backtab\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Backspace: \"Key_Backspace\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Return: \"Key_Return\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Enter: \"Key_Enter\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Insert: \"Key_Insert\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Delete: \"Key_Delete\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Pause: \"Key_Pause\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Print: \"Key_Print\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_SysReq: \"Key_SysReq\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Clear: \"Key_Clear\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_Home: \"Key_Home\",\n"
"    Qt.Key_End: \"Key_End\",\n"
