#. type: Title ==
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:975
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Messages`"
msgstr "`Messages`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:978 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1064
msgid ""
"*`Messages`* module is used to *display pop up dialog messages on the "
"screen*."
msgstr ""
"Das Modul *`Messages`* dient zur *Anzeige von Pop-up-Dialogmeldungen auf dem "
"Bildschirm*."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:980 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1066
msgid "These messages are:"
msgstr "Diese Nachrichten sind:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:982 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1068
msgid "_defined in the INI file under the `[DISPLAY]` heading_, and"
msgstr "_definiert in der INI-Datei unter der Überschrift `[DISPLAY]`_, und"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:983
msgid "_controlled by HAL pins_."
msgstr "_gesteuert durch HAL-Pins_."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:985
msgid ""
"Use this style if you need independent HAL pins for each dialog message."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie diesen Stil, wenn für jede Dialognachricht unabhängige HAL-"
"Pins benötigt werden."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:988
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`BOLDTEXT`*"
msgstr "*`BOLDTEXT`*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:989
msgid "Generally is a title."
msgstr "Ist im Allgemeinen ein Titel."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:989 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1083
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`TEXT`*"
msgstr "*`TEXT`*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:990 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1084
msgid "Text below title, and usually longer."
msgstr "Text unter dem Titel und in der Regel länger."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:990 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1084
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`DETAIL`*"
msgstr "*`DETAIL`*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:991 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1085
msgid "Text hidden unless clicked on."
msgstr "Text ausgeblendet, sofern nicht angeklickt."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:991 src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:2582
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`PINNAME`*"
msgstr "*`PINNAME`*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:992
msgid "Basename of the HAL pin(s)."
msgstr "Basisname der HAL-Pin(s)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:992 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1085
#, no-wrap
msgid "*`TYPE`*"
msgstr "*`TYPE`*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:993
msgid ""
"Specifies whether it is a (can have dialog and status options together):"
msgstr ""
"Gibt an, ob es sich um handelt um (kann gleichzeitig eine Diaglo- und eine "
"Status-Option haben):"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:995 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1088
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*status* - shown in the _status bar and the notify dialog_.\n"
"Requires no user intervention."
msgstr ""
"* status* - angezeigt in der _Statusleiste und im Benachrichtigungsdialog_. \n"
"Erfordert keinen Benutzereingriff."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:996 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1089
msgid "*nonedialog* - specifically does not show a dialog. +"
msgstr "*nonedialog* - legt ausdrücklich fest, keinen Dialog zu zeigen. +"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:998
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*okdialog* - _requiring the user to click OK to close the dialog_.\n"
"OK messages have _two HAL pins_:"
msgstr ""
"* okdialog* - _die den Benutzer auffordert, auf OK zu klicken, um den Dialog zu schließen_.\n"
"OK-Meldungen haben _zwei HAL-Pins_:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:999 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1092
msgid "One HAL pin to launch the dialog, and"
msgstr "Ein HAL-Pin, um den Dialog zu starten, und"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1000
msgid "one to signify it is waiting for a response."
msgstr "einen, um anzuzeigen, dass auf eine Antwort gewartet wird."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1002
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*yesnodialog* - _requiring the user to select yes or no buttons to close the dialog_.\n"
"Yes/No messages have _three HAL pins_:"
msgstr ""
"*yesnodialog* - zwingt denBenutzer, Ja- oder Nein-Schaltflächen zum Schließen des Dialogs auszuwählen_ \n"
"Ja/Nein-Nachrichten haben _drei HAL Pins_:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1003 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1008
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1096
msgid "One to show the dialog,"
msgstr "Einen, um den Dialog anzuzeigen,"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1004 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1009
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1097
msgid "One for waiting, and"
msgstr "Einen für das Warten, und"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1007
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*'okcanceldialog'* - _requiring the user to select ok or cancel\n"
"Ok/Cancel messages have _three HAL pins_:"
msgstr ""
"*message'okcanceldialog* - _zwingt den Benutzer, OK oder Abbrechen zum Schließen des Dialogs auszuwählen_ \n"
"Ja/Nein-Nachrichten haben _drei HAL Pins_:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1011
msgid "*'closepromptdialog'* - _requiring the user to select_"
msgstr "*'closepromptdialog'* - _verlangt eine Auswahl des Anwenders_"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1014 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1101
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"By default, `STATUS` messages for `focus_overlay` and alert sound will be sent when the dialog shows.\n"
"This allows screen 'focus' dimming/blurring and sounds to be added to alerts."
msgstr ""
"Standardmäßig werden `STATUS`-Meldungen für `focus_overlay` und den Warnsound gesendet, sobald der Dialog angezeigt wird.\n"
"So können dem Bildschirm „Fokus“-Abdunkelung/Unschärfe und Töne zu Warnungen hinzugefügt werden."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1017
msgid "The HAL pin names would use these patterns:"
msgstr "Die HAL Pin Namen würden dieses Muster verwenden:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1018
#, no-wrap
msgid "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>_*"
msgstr "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>_*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1019 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1076
msgid "invoking s32 pin"
msgstr "invoking s32 pin"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1019
#, no-wrap
msgid "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-waiting_*"
msgstr "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-waiting_*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1020 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1077
msgid "'Waiting for the user's response' output bit pin"
msgstr "\"Warten auf Reaktion des Anwendes\"-Ausgabe bit Pin"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1020
#, no-wrap
msgid "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-response_*"
msgstr "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-response_*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1021 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1078
msgid "'The user response' output bit pin"
msgstr "'Die Anwender-Reaktion' output bit pin"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1021
#, no-wrap
msgid "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-response-s32_*"
msgstr "*_<SCREEN BASENAME>.<PINNAME>-response-s32_*"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1022 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1079
msgid "'The user response' output s32 pin"
msgstr "'Die Anwender-Reaktion' output s32 pin"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1026 src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1105
msgid ""
"Here are sample INI message definition code blocks that would be found under "
"the `[DISPLAY]` heading:"
msgstr ""
"Hier sind Beispiele für Codeblöcke zur Definition von INI-Nachrichten, die "
"unter der Überschrift `[DISPLAY]' zu finden sind:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1028
msgid "Status bar and desktop notify pop up message:"
msgstr "Statusleiste und Desktop-Benachrichtigungs-Pop-up-Meldung:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1036
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = NONE\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = This is a statusbar test\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = STATUS DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = status\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = statustest\n"
msgstr ""
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = NONE\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = This is a statusbar test\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = STATUS DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = status\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = statustest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1039
msgid "Pop up dialog asking a Yes/No question:"
msgstr "Pop-up-Dialog mit einer Ja/Nein-Frage:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1047
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = NONE\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = This is a yes no dialog test\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = Y/N DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = yesnodialog\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = yndialogtest\n"
msgstr ""
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = NONE\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = This is a yes no dialog test\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = Y/N DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = yesnodialog\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = yndialogtest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1050
msgid ""
"Pop up dialog asking an OK answer + Status bar and desktop notification:"
msgstr ""
"Pop-up-Dialog, der eine OK-Antwort verlangt + Statusleiste und Desktop-"
"Benachrichtigung:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1058
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = This is the short text\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = This is the longer text of the both type test. It can be longer then the status bar text\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = BOTH DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = okdialog status\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = bothtest\n"
msgstr ""
"[DISPLAY]\n"
"MESSAGE_BOLDTEXT = Dies ist der kurze Text\n"
"MESSAGE_TEXT = Dies ist der längere Text des Tests der beiden Typen. Er kann länger sein als der Text der Statusleiste\n"
"MESSAGE_DETAILS = BOTH DETAILS\n"
"MESSAGE_TYPE = okdialog status\n"
"MESSAGE_PINNAME = bothtest\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1061
msgid "The `ScreenOptions` widget can automatically set up the message system."
