msgid "`Player`"
msgstr "`Player`"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1178
msgid "This module *allows playing sounds using Gstreamer, beep and Espeak*."
msgstr ""
"Dieses Modul *ermöglicht das Abspielen von Sounds mit Gstreamer, Beep und "
"Espeak*."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1180
msgid "It can:"
msgstr "Es kann:"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1182
msgid "*play sound/music files* using _Gstreamer_ (non blocking),"
msgstr ""
"*Abspielen von Sound-/Musikdateien* mit _Gstreamer_ (nicht blockierend),"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1183
msgid ""
"*play sounds* using the `beep` library (currently blocks while beeping),"
msgstr ""
"*Sounds abspielen* unter Verwendung der `beep`-Bibliothek (blockiert derzeit "
"beim Piepsen),"

