"Fügen Sie diesen Python-Code zu Ihrem instanziierten Abschnitt hinzu:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1238
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"SOUND = Player()\n"
"SOUND._register_messages()\n"
msgstr ""
"SOUND = Player()\n"
"SOUND._register_messages()\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1242
msgid ""
"The *`_register_messages()`* function connects the audio player to the "
"`STATUS` library so sounds can be played with the `STATUS` message system."
msgstr ""
"Die Funktion *`_register_messages()`* verbindet den Audioplayer mit der "
"`STATUS`-Bibliothek, so dass Klänge mit dem `STATUS`-Meldungssystem "
"abgespielt werden können."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1246
msgid "To play sounds upon `STATUS` messages, use these general syntaxes:"
msgstr ""
"Um Töne mit `STATUS`-Meldungen abzuspielen, verwenden Sie diese allgemeine "
"Syntax:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-libraries.adoc:1253
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','LOGOUT')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','BEEP')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','SPEAK This is a test screen for Q t V C P')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-sound', 'PATH TO SOUND')\n"
msgstr ""
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','LOGOUT')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','BEEP')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-alert','SPEAK This is a test screen for Q t V C P')\n"
"STATUS.emit('play-sound', 'PATH TO SOUND')\n"

