#. type: Plain text
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:3001
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Stylesheets*:\n"
"You would usually use the Qt Designer widget name with `#` _prefix_ to set individual widget properties, otherwise you would use the `JoyPad` _class name_ to set all `JoyPad` widgets the same:"
msgstr ""
"*Stylesheets*: \n"
"Normalerweise würden Sie den Qt Designer Widget-Namen mit `#` _Präfix_ verwenden, um individuelle Widget-Eigenschaften zu setzen, andernfalls würden Sie den `JoyPad` _Klassenname_ nutzen, um alle `JoyPad` Widgets gleich zu setzen:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: src/gui/qtvcp-widgets.adoc:3008
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#joypadname{\n"
"  qproperty-true_color: #000;\n"
"  qproperty-false_color: #444;\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"#joypadname{\n"
"  qproperty-true_color: #000;\n"
"  qproperty-false_color: #444;\n"
"}\n"

