"(float) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.position-cmd` - Desired motor position, in "
"position units (position mode only)."
msgstr ""
"(float) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.position-cmd` - Gewünschte Motorposition, in "
"Positionseinheiten (nur Positionsmodus)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:67
