"'capture_position()'."
msgstr ""
"(s32) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.counts` - Rückmeldeposition in Zählungen, "
"aktualisiert durch 'capture_position()'."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:69
msgid ""
"(float) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.position-fb` - Feedback position in position "
"units, updated by 'capture_position()'."
msgstr ""
"(float) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.position-fb` - Feedback-Position in "
