"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.step` - Step pulse output (step type 0 only)."
msgstr ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.step` - Schrittimpulsausgang (nur Schritttyp 0)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:72
msgid "(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.dir` - Direction output (step type 0 only)."
