"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.dir` - Richtungsausgabe (nur Schritttyp 0)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:73
msgid ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.up` - UP pseudo-PWM output (step type 1 only)."
msgstr ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.up` - UP Pseudo-PWM Ausgang (nur Schritttyp 1)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:74
msgid ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.down` - DOWN pseudo-PWM output (step type 1 "
"only)."
msgstr ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.down` - DOWN Pseudo-PWM-Ausgang (nur Schritttyp "
