#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:76
msgid ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.phase-B` - Phase B output (step types 2-14 only)."
msgstr ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.phase-B` - Ausgang Phase B (nur Schritttypen "
