#. type: Plain text
#: src/hal/rtcomps.adoc:78
msgid ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.phase-D` - Phase D output (step types 5-14 only)."
msgstr ""
"(bit) `stepgen.`__<chan>__`.phase-D` - Phase-D-Ausgang (nur Schritttypen "
