#. type: Title =
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "hal_create_thread(3)"
msgstr "hal_create_thread(3)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:6
msgid "hal_create_thread - Create a HAL thread"
msgstr "hal_create_thread - Erzeugt einen HAL-Thread"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:10
msgid ""
"int hal_create_thread(const char* _name_, unsigned long _period_, int "
"_uses_fp_)"
msgstr ""
"int hal_create_thread(const char* _name_, unsigned long _period_, int "
"_uses_fp_)"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:12
msgid "int hal_thread_delete(const char* _name_)"
msgstr "int hal_thread_delete(const char* _name_)"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:15
#: src/man/man3/hal_export_funct.3.adoc:17 src/man/man3/hal_pin_new.3.adoc:38
#: src/man/man3/hm2_bspi_setup_chan.3.adoc:21
#: src/man/man3/rtapi_region.3.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "name"
msgstr "name"

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "period"
msgstr "period"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:19
msgid "The interval, in nanoseconds, between iterations of the thread."
msgstr ".Das Intervall, in Nanosekunden, zwischen den Iterationen des Threads."

#. type: Labeled list
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:19
#: src/man/man3/hal_export_funct.3.adoc:23
#: src/man/man3/rtapi_task_new.3.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "uses_fp"
msgstr "uses_fp"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Must be nonzero if a function which uses floating-point will be attached to "
"this thread."
msgstr ""
"Muss ungleich Null sein, wenn eine Funktion, die Fließkommazahlen verwendet, "
"an diesen Thread angehängt wird."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:26
msgid ""
"*hal_create_thread* establishes a realtime thread that will execute one or "
"more HAL functions periodically."
msgstr ""
"*hal_create_thread* richtet einen Echtzeit-Thread ein, der eine oder mehrere "
"HAL-Funktionen periodisch ausführt."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:33
msgid ""
"All thread periods are rounded to integer multiples of the hardware timer "
"period, and the timer period is based on the first thread created.  Threads "
"must be created in order, from the fastest to the slowest.  HAL assigns "
"decreasing priorities to threads that are created later, so creating them "
"from fastest to slowest results in rate monotonic priority scheduling."
msgstr ""
"Alle Thread-Perioden werden auf ganzzahlige Vielfache der Hardware-Timer-"
"Periode gerundet, und die Timer-Periode basiert auf dem ersten erstellten "
"Thread.  Die Threads müssen in der Reihenfolge vom schnellsten zum "
"langsamsten erstellt werden.  HAL weist Threads, die später erstellt werden, "
"abnehmende Prioritäten zu, so dass die Erstellung der Threads vom "
"schnellsten zum langsamsten zu einer monotonen Prioritätsplanung führt."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:35
msgid "*hal_delete_thread* deletes a previously created thread."
msgstr "*hal_delete_thread* löscht einen zuvor erstellten Thread."

#. type: Title =
#: src/man/man3/hal_create_thread.3.adoc:46
#: src/man/man3/hal_export_funct.3.adoc:3
