#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/knob2float.9:64
msgid "B<knob2float>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-out> float rw (default: I<1\\&.0>)"
msgstr ""
"B<knob2float>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-out> float rw (Voreinstellung: I<1\\&.0>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/knob2float.9:66
msgid "Maximum output value, further increases in count will be ignored"
msgstr "Maximaler Ausgangswert, weitere Erhöhungen der Anzahl werden ignoriert"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/knob2float.9:69
msgid "B<knob2float>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-out> float rw (default: I<0\\&.0>)"
msgstr ""
"B<knob2float>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-out> float rw (Voreinstellung: I<0\\&.0>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/knob2float.9:71
msgid "Minimum output value, further decreases in count will be ignored"
msgstr ""
"Minimaler Ausgabewert, weitere Verringerungen der Anzahl werden ignoriert"

#. type: TH
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "LATENCYBINS"
msgstr "LATENCYBINS"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:32
msgid "latencybins - comp utility for scripts/latency-histogram"
msgstr "latencybins - Dienstprogramm für Skripte/Latenzhistogramm"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:35
msgid ""
"B<loadrt latencybins> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"
msgstr ""
"B<loadrt latencybins> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:38
msgid ""
"Read B<availablebins> pin for the number of bins available\\&. Set the "
"B<maxbinnumber> pin for the number of \\(+-;bins\\&. Ensure B<maxbinnumber> "
"≤ B<availablebins>\\&."
msgstr ""
"Lesen Sie den Pin B<availablebins>, um die Anzahl der verfügbaren Bins zu "
"bestimmen. Setzen Sie den Pin B<maxbinnumber> für die Anzahl der\\(+-;Bins. "
"Stellen Sie sicher, dass B<maxbinnumber> ≤ B<availablebins> ist."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:40
msgid "For B<maxbinnumber> = N, the bins are numbered:"
msgstr "Für B<maxbinnumber> = N, die bins sind nummeriert:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:50
msgid "-N \\&... 0 \\&... +N bins"
msgstr "-N \\&... 0 \\&... +N bins"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:52
msgid "(the -0 bin is not populated)"
msgstr "(der -0 bin ist nicht belegt)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:54
msgid "(total effective bins = 2 * maxbinnumber + 1)"
msgstr "(total effective bins = 2 * maxbinnumber + 1)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:57
msgid "Set B<nsbinsize> pin for the binsize (ns)\\&."
msgstr "Setzt B<nsbinsize> Pin für die binsize (ns)\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:73
msgid "Set B<index> pin to a bin number: 0 ≤ B<index> ≤ maxbinnumber\\&."
msgstr ""
"Setzt B<index> Pin zu einer bin Nummer: 0 ≤ B<index> ≤ maxbinnumber\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:86
msgid "Read check pin and verify that check pin == B<index> pin\\&."
msgstr "Liest check Pin und überprüft, dass check Pin == B<index> pin\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:97
msgid "Read output pins:"
msgstr "Eingangspins lesen:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:108
msgid "B<pbinvalue> is count for bin = +B<index>"
msgstr "B<pbinvalue> ist Zähler für bin = +B<index>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:120
msgid "B<nbinvalue> is count for bin = -B<index>"
msgstr "B<nbinvalue> ist Zähler für bin = -B<index>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:133
msgid "B<pextra> is count for all bins E<gt> B<maxbinnumber>"
msgstr "B<pextra> ist Zähler für alle bins E<gt> B<maxbinnumber>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:146
msgid "B<nextra> is count for all bins E<lt> B<maxbinnumber>"
msgstr "B<nextra> ist Zähler für alle bins E<lt> B<maxbinnumber>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:158
msgid "B<latency-min> is max negative latency"
msgstr "B<latency-min> ist maximale negative Latenz"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:170
msgid "B<latency-max> is max positive latency"
msgstr "B<latency-max> ist maximale positive Latenz"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:174
msgid ""
"If B<index> is out of range (B<index> E<lt> 0 or B<index> E<gt> "
"B<maxbinnumber>) then B<pbinvalue> = B<nbinvalue> = -1\\&. The reset pin may "
"be used to restart\\&."
msgstr ""
"Wenn index außerhalb des Bereichs liegt (index E<lt> 0 oder index E<gt> "
"maxbinnumber) dann ist B<pbinvalue> = B<nbinvalue> = -1. Der Reset-Pin kann "
"zum Neustart verwendet werden."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:176
msgid "The latency pin outputs the instantaneous latency\\&."
msgstr "Der latency-Pin gibt die augenblickliche Latenz (Verzögerung) an\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:178
msgid "Maintainers note: hardcoded for MAXBINNUMBER==1000"
msgstr "Anmerkung des Maintainers: Hardcodiert für MAXBINNUMBER==1000"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:181
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:186
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxbinnumber> s32 in (default: I<1000>)"
msgstr ""
"B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxbinnumber> s32 in (Voreinstellung: I<1000>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:190
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<index> s32 in"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<index> s32 in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:194
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<reset> bit in"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<reset> bit in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:198
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nsbinsize> s32 in"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nsbinsize> s32 in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:202
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<check> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<check> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:206
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:210
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency-max> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency-max> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:214
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency-min> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<latency-min> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:218
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pbinvalue> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pbinvalue> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:222
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nbinvalue> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nbinvalue> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:226
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pextra> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pextra> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:230
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nextra> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<nextra> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:234
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<variance> s32 out"
msgstr "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<variance> s32 out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/latencybins.9:238
msgid "B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<availablebins> s32 out (default: I<1000>)"
msgstr ""
"B<latencybins>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<availablebins> s32 out (Voreinstellung: I<1000>)"

#. type: TH
#: man/man9/limit1.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIMIT1"
msgstr "LIMIT1"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:32
msgid "limit1 - Limit the output signal to fall between min and max"
msgstr ""
"limit1 - Begrenzung des Ausgangssignals auf einen Wert zwischen min und max"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:35
msgid "B<loadrt limit1> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"
msgstr "B<loadrt limit1> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:38
msgid "B<limit1>\\&.I<N> (requires a floating-point thread)"
msgstr "B<limit1>\\&.I<N> (benötigt Gleitkomma-Thread)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:43
msgid "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"
msgstr "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:47
msgid "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"
msgstr "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:51
msgid "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-> float in (default: I<-1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit1>\\&I<N>B<.min> float in (Voreinstellung: I<-1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit1.9:55
msgid "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (default: I<1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit1>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e20>)"

#. type: TH
#: man/man9/limit2.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIMIT2"
msgstr "LIMIT2"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:32
msgid ""
"limit2 - Limit the output signal to fall between min and max and limit its "
"slew rate to less than maxv per second\\&. When the signal is a position, "
"this means that position and velocity are limited\\&."
msgstr ""
"limit2 - Begrenzt das Ausgangssignal auf einen Wert zwischen min und max und "
"begrenzt seine Anstiegsgeschwindigkeit auf weniger als maxv pro Sekunde. "
"Wenn das Signal eine Position ist, bedeutet dies, dass Position und "
"Geschwindigkeit begrenzt sind."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:35
msgid "B<loadrt limit2> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"
msgstr "B<loadrt limit2> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:38
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N> (requires a floating-point thread)"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N> (erfordert einen Gleitkomma-Thread)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:43
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:47
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:51
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<load> bit in"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<load> bit in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:56
msgid "When TRUE, immediately set B<out> to B<in>, ignoring maxv"
msgstr ""
"Wenn TRUE, wird sofort B<out> to B<in> gesetzt, ohne Berücksichtigung von "
"maxv"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:59
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-> float in (default: I<-1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-> float in (Voreinstellung: I<-1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:63
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (default: I<1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit2.9:67
msgid "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxv> float in (default: I<1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit2>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxv> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e20>)"

#. type: TH
#: man/man9/limit3.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "LIMIT3"
msgstr "LIMIT3"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:32
msgid "limit3 - Follow input signal while obeying limits"
msgstr "limit3 - Dem Eingangssignal folgen und dabei die Grenzwerte einhalten"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:35
msgid ""
"Limit the output signal to fall between min and max, limit its slew rate to "
"less than maxv per second, and limit its second derivative to less than maxa "
"per second squared\\&. When the signal is a position, this means that the "
"position, velocity, and acceleration are limited\\&."
msgstr ""
"Begrenzen Sie das Ausgangssignal auf einen Wert zwischen min und max, seine "
"Anstiegsrate auf weniger als maxv pro Sekunde und seine zweite Ableitung auf "
"weniger als maxa pro Sekunde zum Quadrat. Wenn es sich bei dem Signal um "
"eine Position handelt, bedeutet dies, dass die Position, die Geschwindigkeit "
"und die Beschleunigung begrenzt sind."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:38
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N> (requires a floating-point thread)"
msgstr "B<Limit3>\\&.I<N> (erfordert Gleitkomma-Thread)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:43
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in> float in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:47
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<enable> bit in (default: I<1>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<enable> bit in (Voreinstellung: I<1>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:49
msgid "1: out follows in, 0: out returns to 0 (always per constraints)"
msgstr "1: out folgt in, 0: out kehrt zu 0 zurück (immer gemäß Einschränkung)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:52
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out> float out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:56
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<load> bit in (default: I<0>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<load> bit in (Voreinstellung: I<0>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:61
msgid "When TRUE, immediately set B<out> to B<in>, ignoring maxv and maxa"
msgstr ""
"Wenn TRUE, wird sofort B<out> auf B<in> gesetzt, ohne Berücksichtigung von "
"maxv und maxa"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:64
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<min-> float in (default: I<-1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>B<.min> float in (Voreinstellung: I<-1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:68
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (default: I<1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<max-> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:72
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxv> float in (default: I<1e20>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxv> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e20>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:76
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxa> float in (default: I<1e7>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<maxa> float in (Voreinstellung: I<1e7>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:78
msgid ""
"Max Acceleration\\&. Note that the component becomes unstable with maxa "
"greater than about 1e7 in a 1kHz thread"
msgstr ""
"Max Beschleunigung (engl. max acceleration)\\&. Beachten Sie, dass die "
"Komponente mit maxa größer als 1e7 in einem 1kHz-Gewinde instabil wird"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:81
msgid "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<smooth-steps> u32 in (default: I<2>)"
msgstr "B<limit3>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<smooth-steps> u32 in (Voreinstellung: I<2>)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/limit3.9:83
msgid ""
"Smooth out acceleration this many periods before reaching input or max/min "
"limit\\&. Higher values avoid oscillation, but will accelerate slightly more "
"slowly\\&."
msgstr ""
"Glätten Sie die Beschleunigung so viele Perioden vor Erreichen der Eingangs- "
"oder Max/Min-Grenze. Höhere Werte vermeiden Schwingungen, beschleunigen aber "
"etwas langsamer."

#. type: TH
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "LINCURVE"
msgstr "LINCURVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:32
msgid "lincurve - one-dimensional lookup table"
msgstr "lincurve - eindimensionale lookup-Tabelle"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:35
msgid ""
"B<loadrt lincurve> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]] "
"[B<personality>=I<P1>[,I<P2>\\&...]]"
msgstr ""
"B<loadrt lincurve> [B<count>=I<N>|B<names>=I<name1>[,I<name2>\\&...]] "
"[B<personality>=I<P1>[,I<P2>\\&...]]"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:38
msgid ""
"This component can be used to map any floating-point input to a floating-"
"point output\\&. Typical uses would include linearisation of thermocouples, "
"defining PID gains that vary with external factors or to substitute for any "
"mathematical function where absolute accuracy is not required\\&."
msgstr ""
"Diese Komponente kann verwendet werden, um eine beliebige Gleitkomma-Eingabe "
"auf eine Gleitkomma-Ausgabe abzubilden\\&. Typische Anwendungen sind die "
"Linearisierung von Thermoelementen, die Definition von PID-Verstärkungen, "
"die von externen Faktoren abhängen, oder der Ersatz von mathematischen "
"Funktionen, für die keine absolute Genauigkeit erforderlich ist\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:40
msgid ""
"The component can be thought of as a 2-dimensional graph of points in (x,y) "
"space joined by straight lines\\&. The input value is located on the x axis, "
"followed up until it touches the line, and the output of the component is "
"set to the corresponding y-value\\&."
msgstr ""
"Die Komponente kann man sich als 2-dimensionales Diagramm von Punkten im "
"(x,y)-Raum vorstellen, die durch gerade Linien verbunden sind\\&. Der "
"Eingabewert befindet sich auf der x-Achse, wird bis zur Berührung der Linie "
"verfolgt, und der Ausgang der Komponente wird auf den entsprechenden y-Wert "
"gesetzt\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:42
msgid ""
"The (x,y) points are defined by the x-val-NN and y-val-NN parameters which "
"need to be set in the HAL file using \"setp\" commands\\&."
msgstr ""
"Die (x,y)-Punkte werden durch die Parameter x-val-NN und y-val-NN definiert, "
"die in der HAL-Datei mit \"setp\"-Befehlen eingestellt werden müssen\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:44
msgid "The maximum number if (x,y) points supported is 16\\&."
msgstr "Die maximale Anzahl der unterstützten (x,y)-Punkte beträgt 16\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:46
msgid ""
"For input values less than the x-val-00 breakpoint the y-val-00 is "
"returned\\&. For x greater than the largest x-val-NN the yval corresponding "
"to x-max is returned (ie, no extrapolation is performed\\&.)"
msgstr ""
"Für Eingabewerte, die kleiner als der Haltepunkt x-val-00 sind, wird der y-"
"val-00 zurückgegeben. Für x, das größer ist als der größte x-val-NN, wird "
"der yval zurückgegeben, der x-max entspricht (d. h. es wird keine "
"Extrapolation durchgeführt)."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:48
msgid ""
"Sample usage: loadrt lincurve count=3 personality=4,4,4 for a set of three 4-"
"element graphs\\&."
msgstr ""
"Anwendungsbeispiel: loadrt lincurve count=3 personality=4,4,4 für einen Satz "
"von drei 4-Element-Graphen\\&."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:51
msgid "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N> (requires a floating-point thread)"
msgstr "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N> (erfordert Gleitkomma Thread)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:56
msgid "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in-> float in"
msgstr "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<in-> float in"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:61
msgid "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out-> float out"
msgstr "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out-> float out"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:63 man/man9/offset.9:61
msgid "The output value"
msgstr "Der Ausgabewert"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:66
msgid "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out-io> float io"
msgstr "B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<out-io> float io"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:68
msgid "The output value, compatible with PID gains"
msgstr "Der Ausgangswert, kompatibel mit PID-Verstärkungen"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/lincurve.9:72
msgid ""
"B<lincurve>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<x-val->I<MM> float rw (MM=00\\&.\\&.personality)"
