#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:32
msgid "mesa_7i65 - Support for the Mesa 7i65 Octuple Servo Card"
msgstr "mesa_7i65 - Unterstützung für die Mesa 7i65 Achtfach-Servokarte"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:35
msgid "B<loadrt mesa_7i65>"
msgstr "B<loadrt mesa_7i65>"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:38
msgid ""
"The component takes parameters in the form of a comma-separated list of bspi "
"(buffered SPI) instance names, for example:"
msgstr ""
"Die Komponente nimmt Parameter in Form einer kommagetrennten Liste von bspi "
"(buffered SPI) Instanznamen entgegen:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "loadrt mesa_7i65 bspi_chans=hm2_5i23\\&.0\\&.bspi\\&.0, hm2_5i23\\&.0\\&.bspi\\&.1\n"
msgstr "loadrt mesa_7i65 bspi_chans=hm2_5i23\\&.0\\&.bspi\\&.0, hm2_5i23\\&.0\\&.bspi\\&.1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:50
msgid ""
"The BSPI instances are printed to the dmesg buffer during the Hostmot2 setup "
"sequence, one for each bspi instance included in the bitfile loaded to each "
"installed card during the Hostmot2 setup sequence\\&. Type \"dmesg\" at the "
"terminal prompt to view the output\\&."
msgstr ""
"Die BSPI-Instanzen werden während der Hostmot2-Setup-Sequenz in den dmesg-"
"Puffer gedruckt, eine für jede BSPI-Instanz, die in der Bitdatei enthalten "
"ist, die während der Hostmot2-Setup-Sequenz auf jede installierte Karte "
"geladen wird. Geben Sie \"dmesg\" an der Terminal-Eingabeaufforderung ein, "
"um die Ausgabe zu sehen."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:53
msgid ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<analogue\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.out> float in (M=0\\&.\\&.7)"
msgstr ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<analogue\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.out> float in (M=0\\&.\\&.7)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:55
msgid ""
"Analogue output values\\&. The value will be limited to a -1\\&.0 to +1\\&.0 "
"range"
msgstr ""
"Analoge Ausgangswerte. Der Wert wird auf einen Bereich von -1,0 bis +1,0 "
"begrenzt."

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:58
msgid ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<analogue\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.in> float out (M=0\\&.\\&.7)"
msgstr ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<analogue\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.in> float out (M=0\\&.\\&.7)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:60
msgid "Analogue outputs read by the 7i65 (in Volts)"
msgstr "Vom 7i65 gelesene analoge Ausgänge (in Volt)"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/mesa_7i65.9:63
msgid ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<digital\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.in> bit out (M=0\\&.\\&.3)"
msgstr ""
"B<mesa-7i65>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<digital\\&.>I<M>B<\\&.in> bit out (M=0\\&.\\&.3)"

