#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:86
msgid ""
"In your post-gui\\&.hal file you might use one of the following to connect "
"this timer:"
msgstr ""
"In Ihrer post-gui.hal Datei können Sie eine der folgenden Möglichkeiten "
"verwenden, um diesen Timer zu verbinden:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:88
msgid "For a new config:"
msgstr "Für eine neue Konfiguration:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:100
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" loadrt time\n"
" addf time\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" net cycle-timer        time\\&.0\\&.start E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-running\n"
" net cycle-timer-pause  time\\&.0\\&.pause E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-paused\n"
" net cycle-seconds pyvcp\\&.time-seconds E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.seconds\n"
" net cycle-minutes pyvcp\\&.time-minutes E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.minutes\n"
" net cycle-hours pyvcp\\&.time-hours E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.hours\n"
msgstr ""
" loadrt time\n"
" addf time\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" net cycle-timer        time\\&.0\\&.start E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-running\n"
" net cycle-timer-pause  time\\&.0\\&.pause E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-paused\n"
" net cycle-seconds pyvcp\\&.time-seconds E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.seconds\n"
" net cycle-minutes pyvcp\\&.time-minutes E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.minutes\n"
" net cycle-hours pyvcp\\&.time-hours E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.hours\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:106
msgid ""
"Previous to this version if you wanted the timer to continue running during "
"a pause instead of resetting, you had to use a HAL NOT component to invert "
"the B<halui>\\&.B<program>\\&.B<is-idle> pin and connect to "
"B<time>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<start> as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"Wenn Sie vor dieser Version wollten, dass der Timer während einer Pause "
"weiterläuft während einer Pause weiterläuft, anstatt zurückgesetzt zu "
"werden, musste man eine HAL NOT Komponente verwenden, um den Pin "
"halui.program.is-idle zu invertieren und mit time.N.start zu verbinden, wie "
"unten gezeigt:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:120
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" loadrt time\n"
" loadrt not\n"
" addf time\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" addf not\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" net prog-running not\\&.0\\&.in E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-idle\n"
" net cycle-timer time\\&.0\\&.start E<lt>= not\\&.0\\&.out\n"
" net cycle-seconds pyvcp\\&.time-seconds E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.seconds\n"
" net cycle-minutes pyvcp\\&.time-minutes E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.minutes\n"
" net cycle-hours pyvcp\\&.time-hours E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.hours\n"
msgstr ""
" loadrt time\n"
" loadrt not\n"
" addf time\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" addf not\\&.0 servo-thread\n"
" net prog-running not\\&.0\\&.in E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-idle\n"
" net cycle-timer time\\&.0\\&.start E<lt>= not\\&.0\\&.out\n"
" net cycle-seconds pyvcp\\&.time-seconds E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.seconds\n"
" net cycle-minutes pyvcp\\&.time-minutes E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.minutes\n"
" net cycle-hours pyvcp\\&.time-hours E<lt>= time\\&.0\\&.hours\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:126
msgid ""
"For those who have this setup already, you can simply add a net connecting "
"B<time>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pause> to B<halui>\\&.B<program>\\&.B<is-paused>:"
msgstr ""
"Für diejenigen, die dies bereits eingerichtet haben, können Sie einfach eine "
"Netzverbindung hinzufügen durch Verbinden von B<time>\\&.I<N>\\&.B<pause> "
"mit B<halui>\\&.B<program>\\&.B<is-paused>:"

#. type: Plain text
#: man/man9/time.9:132
#, no-wrap
msgid " net cycle-timer-pause time\\&.0\\&.pause E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-paused\n"
msgstr " net cycle-timer-pause time\\&.0\\&.pause E<lt>= halui\\&.program\\&.is-paused\n"

