#~ "With -- --enablepw _<password>_ Sets the enable password to _password_. "
#~ "Default 'EMCTOO'.  With -- --sessions <max sessions> Sets the maximum "
#~ "number of simultaneous connextions to max sessions.  Default is no limit "
#~ "(-1).  With -- --path Sets the base path to program (G-Code) files, "
#~ "default is \"../../nc_files/\". Make sure to include the final slash "
#~ "(/).  With -- -ini _<INI file>_, uses specified _INI file_ instead of "
